  "title": "SPEC-VAL-010 — 21 CFR Part 11 Electronic Records & Signature Validation Events",
  "description": "Document 113 event contract for the events app/modules/validation/commands_part11.py actually emits. All 3 of the catalogue's declared Document 88 events are implemented: Part11AssessmentCreated, Part11TestSuiteDerived (also re-emitted when an individual control-evidence result is recorded, same event_type, same shared-suite aggregate concept), Part11QualificationApproved. Verified directly against source, including indirection through the shared finalize() helper and, where present, dict-keyed event-type lookups and parameterized shared helpers -- not a literal-string grep alone.",
